# Compact configs, episode summaries, and pruning records are scientific inputs.
# Large per-step inputs stay local and are inventoried in protected_inputs.json.
**/runs_aborted/
**/.locks/
**/*.log
**/*.lock

# Bulky per-step artifacts outside the raw run directories.
**/rollout/*/
**/traces/
**/*.mp4
**/*.jpg
**/wandb/
**/frames/
**/selector/
**/horizon/
# Chained launch logs (Ray/progress noise, several MB each; each arm's launch.log is kept) and
# derived files over GitHub's 100 MB limit (aggregate.py rebuilds masks.parquet from the runs).
**/driver.log
**/driver.log.partial
token_prune/results/masks.parquet
